          non sollicitudin euismod, luctus et quam.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="what section__home" aria-labelledby="what-heading">
      <h2 id="what-heading" class="section__heading">What We Do</h2>
      <div class="section__text">
        <Tabs />
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="why section__home" aria-labelledby="why-heading">
      <h2 id="why-heading" class="section__heading">Why Choose Us</h2>
      <div class="section__text">
        <p>
          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Aenean
